check 1
# Battle Orders (self cast): ScnBar (expansion Barbarian, level 30, every skill at 20, right
# skill 149), -seed 1234; warp to the Blood Moor (level 2; variant
# blood-moor-empty: no monster population there) before frame 4,
# a Fallen (class 19) 4 sub-tiles away along +x (client pixel about 496, 296) before frame 10, then one right
# click at client pixel (330, 300), before frame 20's drain. Compares the cast
# (mode, states, stats), its missiles' effects on the Fallen and the
# draws. Area F2 (q-diff-skills-2). Spec: specs/tools/scenario-diff.md.
name bar-battle-orders
save ScnBar --class bar --expansion --level 30 --all-skills 20 --right-skill 149
seed 1234
ticks 70
seconds 300
channels state
variant blood-moor-empty
at 4 poke warp 2
input frame 20; rclick 330 300
